WEBVTT

1
00:02:03.375 --> 00:02:07.375
In the previous verses of the
eleventh chapter, by Arjun,

2
00:02:07.375 --> 00:02:11.291
Lord Krishna's divine vision of
the Vishwarupa was described.

3
00:02:11.291 --> 00:02:14.875
Now in these five verses, of this divine vision

4
00:02:14.875 --> 00:02:15.666
many more

5
00:02:15.666 --> 00:02:18.500
aspects come to be seen.

6
00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:20.000
As Arjun

7
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.708
continues to observe the Vishwarupa,

8
00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:25.291
his emotions begin to shift.

9
00:02:25.291 --> 00:02:29.375
At first he was struck by its
vastness and radiance,

10
00:02:29.375 --> 00:02:34.666
but now he begins to see its terrifying aspects.

11
00:02:34.666 --> 00:02:36.000
He realises

12
00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:38.833
that this is not merely a magnificent vision.

13
00:02:38.833 --> 00:02:41.541
This is Lord Krishna's Kala Svarupa,

14
00:02:41.541 --> 00:02:44.750
the form of time, which destroys all.

15
00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:45.833
In this moment, Arjun

16
00:02:45.833 --> 00:02:48.458
understands a deep truth.

17
00:02:48.458 --> 00:02:50.250
Lord Krishna is not only the creator

18
00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:52.250
and sustainer,

19
00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:55.166
but also the destroyer.

20
00:02:55.166 --> 00:02:58.583
This realisation shakes him to the core,

21
00:02:58.583 --> 00:03:03.208
and for the first time, his wonder turns to fear.

22
00:03:08.083 --> 00:03:10.750
Describing all that he has just seen,

23
00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:14.333
Arjun is shaken from within.

24
00:03:14.333 --> 00:03:16.916
He says to Lord Krishna,

25
00:03:16.916 --> 00:03:20.666
'You have no beginning, middle, or end.

26
00:03:20.666 --> 00:03:23.125
Your power is limitless.'

27
00:03:23.125 --> 00:03:26.333
This means Lord Krishna is beyond time.

28
00:03:26.333 --> 00:03:29.958
He was always, and will always be.

29
00:03:29.958 --> 00:03:31.166
Arjun sees

30
00:03:31.166 --> 00:03:32.625
that the sun and moon

31
00:03:32.625 --> 00:03:34.333
are Lord Krishna's eyes,

32
00:03:34.333 --> 00:03:36.000
and from His mouth blazes

33
00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:39.833
a consuming fire that burns everything.

34
00:03:39.833 --> 00:03:43.375
This is the first sign of Lord Krishna's Kala Rupa,

35
00:03:43.375 --> 00:03:45.083
which, in the coming verses,

36
00:03:45.083 --> 00:03:48.000
will become even clearer.

37
00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:50.750
Although Lord Krishna is one,

38
00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.916
He pervades the entire universe.

39
00:03:53.916 --> 00:03:56.541
The sky, the planets, and the space

40
00:03:56.541 --> 00:04:00.000
between them are all filled with His presence.

41
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.458
Seeing this, all the worlds,

42
00:04:02.458 --> 00:04:04.875
including heaven and earth, tremble.

43
00:04:04.875 --> 00:04:06.958
The devas are astonished,

44
00:04:06.958 --> 00:04:09.833
but many among them are also afraid.

45
00:04:09.833 --> 00:04:11.708
Some devas, surrendering,

46
00:04:11.708 --> 00:04:14.250
enter into Lord Krishna's form,

47
00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:18.083
while others join their hands
and pray for protection.

48
00:04:18.083 --> 00:04:19.791
The great rishis and Siddhas

49
00:04:19.791 --> 00:04:23.666
sing Vedic hymns and pray,

50
00:04:23.666 --> 00:04:27.416
'Let there be peace. May all be well.'

51
00:04:27.416 --> 00:04:28.666
This shows

52
00:04:28.666 --> 00:04:31.583
that even the most powerful
beings in the universe

53
00:04:31.583 --> 00:04:32.875
recognise Lord Krishna's

54
00:04:32.875 --> 00:04:35.416
supreme authority.

55
00:04:35.416 --> 00:04:37.541
Arjun sees Lord Shiva,

56
00:04:37.541 --> 00:04:40.125
the Vasus, the Adityas, the Maruts,

57
00:04:40.125 --> 00:04:41.750
the Gandharvas, the Yakshas,

58
00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:44.541
and even the Asuras.

59
00:04:44.541 --> 00:04:45.500
All beholding this grand

60
00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:48.291
vision with complete wonder.

61
00:04:48.291 --> 00:04:49.583
From the devas of heaven

62
00:04:49.583 --> 00:04:51.458
to supernatural beings,

63
00:04:51.458 --> 00:04:53.916
everyone watches in awe.

64
00:04:53.916 --> 00:04:55.041
Understanding

65
00:04:55.041 --> 00:04:58.625
that Lord Krishna is the supreme controller of all.

66
00:04:58.625 --> 00:05:00.625
But as Arjun

67
00:05:00.625 --> 00:05:02.333
looks more closely,

68
00:05:02.333 --> 00:05:05.541
his wonder turns to fear.

69
00:05:05.541 --> 00:05:08.916
He sees Lord Krishna's vast form,

70
00:05:08.916 --> 00:05:09.750
with countless

71
00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:13.500
faces, eyes, arms, and legs.

72
00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:15.208
Most terrifying of all

73
00:05:15.208 --> 00:05:18.458
is that His mouth is filled with fearsome teeth.

74
00:05:18.458 --> 00:05:21.750
This sight disturbs not only the devas,

75
00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.958
but Arjun himself.

76
00:05:23.958 --> 00:05:25.416
He had always known Lord Krishna

77
00:05:25.416 --> 00:05:27.625
as his dearest friend.

78
00:05:27.625 --> 00:05:30.416
But now, seeing Him in this cosmic, all-

79
00:05:30.416 --> 00:05:32.416
powerful form,

80
00:05:32.416 --> 00:05:35.375
Arjun is filled with fear.

81
00:05:35.375 --> 00:05:37.791
This moment is an important turning point.

82
00:05:37.791 --> 00:05:39.541
Until now, Arjun was captivated by Lord Krishna's

83
00:05:39.541 --> 00:05:41.250
divine grandeur,

84
00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:43.375
but now he understands

85
00:05:43.375 --> 00:05:46.708
that the Vishwarupa is not only about creation,

86
00:05:46.708 --> 00:05:49.250
it is also about destruction.

87
00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:51.208
Whatever exists

88
00:05:51.208 --> 00:05:55.041
is ultimately consumed by time,

89
00:05:55.041 --> 00:05:58.791
and Lord Krishna, as time itself, is the one

90
00:05:58.791 --> 00:06:03.291
who brings the inevitable and certain end of all.

91
00:06:03.291 --> 00:06:05.708
Feeling deep unease,

92
00:06:05.708 --> 00:06:08.958
Arjun, seeing this terrifying vision,

93
00:06:08.958 --> 00:06:13.750
prepares to express his distressed state.

94
00:06:18.458 --> 00:06:21.416
Think back to childhood,

95
00:06:21.416 --> 00:06:24.916
when your ever-loving mother

96
00:06:24.916 --> 00:06:28.791
would scold you for a mistake,

97
00:06:28.791 --> 00:06:31.041
how did it feel?

98
00:06:31.041 --> 00:06:35.000
It certainly hurt at the time,

99
00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:39.958
but today you understand that the scolding

100
00:06:39.958 --> 00:06:43.833
was for your own good.

101
00:06:43.833 --> 00:06:45.000
If mistakes had

102
00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.833
not been corrected with discipline at that time,

103
00:06:48.833 --> 00:06:50.875
they would, in the future,

104
00:06:50.875 --> 00:06:54.375
only have harmed you.

105
00:06:54.375 --> 00:06:57.875
I too have two aspects.

106
00:06:57.875 --> 00:06:59.833
A gentle,

107
00:06:59.833 --> 00:07:02.625
loving side,

108
00:07:02.625 --> 00:07:04.875
and a powerful,

109
00:07:04.875 --> 00:07:07.375
all-

110
00:07:07.375 --> 00:07:12.833
consuming side.

111
00:07:12.833 --> 00:07:15.583
In life, everything has

112
00:07:15.583 --> 00:07:18.041
two sides.

113
00:07:18.041 --> 00:07:20.541
Joy and sorrow.

114
00:07:20.541 --> 00:07:23.250
Gain and loss.

115
00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.208
Creation

116
00:07:25.208 --> 00:07:27.750
and destruction.

117
00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:30.708
Arjun saw My Vishwarupa

118
00:07:30.708 --> 00:07:35.125
and understood that, just as I

119
00:07:35.125 --> 00:07:37.041
create

120
00:07:37.041 --> 00:07:40.375
and sustain life,

121
00:07:40.375 --> 00:07:46.791
I also bring it to an end.

122
00:07:46.791 --> 00:07:50.333
This truth may seem disturbing,

123
00:07:50.333 --> 00:07:55.250
but accepting both sides

124
00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:55.958
is, in life,

125
00:07:55.958 --> 00:08:00.416
the key to finding peace and stability.

126
00:08:00.416 --> 00:08:02.583
Think about this,

127
00:08:02.583 --> 00:08:04.291
in a sports competition

128
00:08:04.291 --> 00:08:08.750
many people take part, but

129
00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:12.291
the one who has trained hard,

130
00:08:12.291 --> 00:08:15.625
who, despite unfavourable weather,

131
00:08:15.625 --> 00:08:18.833
bore hardship, gave up the temptation

132
00:08:18.833 --> 00:08:21.833
of sleep, and prepared,

133
00:08:21.833 --> 00:08:26.750
who kept going even after failing many times,

134
00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:30.833
they are the ones who achieve victory.

135
00:08:30.833 --> 00:08:34.166
In sport, along with the joy, accepting also

136
00:08:34.166 --> 00:08:38.041
the harshness of hard work,

137
00:08:38.041 --> 00:08:40.666
this is what makes one successful.

138
00:08:40.666 --> 00:08:42.000
If you

139
00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:46.583
seek only the pleasant side of life

140
00:08:46.583 --> 00:08:50.166
and avoid the difficult part,

141
00:08:50.166 --> 00:08:52.583
then when challenges come,

142
00:08:52.583 --> 00:08:56.041
you will have to struggle.

143
00:08:56.041 --> 00:08:59.750
True strength comes from understanding that

144
00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:02.666
success and failure,

145
00:09:02.666 --> 00:09:05.125
gain and loss,

146
00:09:05.125 --> 00:09:09.500
both are part of life's plan.

147
00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:12.500
Accepting this balance

148
00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:16.625
helps you face challenges without fear

149
00:09:16.625 --> 00:09:19.041
and appreciate joys

150
00:09:19.041 --> 00:09:22.833
without attachment,

151
00:09:22.833 --> 00:09:25.375
and in the same way,

152
00:09:25.375 --> 00:09:28.000
My dual nature,

153
00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.708
compassionate

154
00:09:29.708 --> 00:09:31.166
and powerful.

155
00:09:31.166 --> 00:09:34.416
Accepting both

156
00:09:34.416 --> 00:09:37.250
helps you develop trust

157
00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:41.125
in My plan,

158
00:09:41.125 --> 00:09:44.583
even when life seems uncertain.

159
00:09:44.583 --> 00:09:49.000
When you embrace both sides of life,

160
00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:50.750
you find the strength

161
00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:54.000
to remain steady and at peace,

162
00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:57.583
whatever the situation may bring.

163
00:10:02.416 --> 00:10:08.166
In family life, it is natural to teach all members

164
00:10:08.166 --> 00:10:11.625
that I am compassionate, loving,

165
00:10:11.625 --> 00:10:13.708
and a giver of blessings.

166
00:10:13.708 --> 00:10:15.958
This is true,

167
00:10:15.958 --> 00:10:20.666
but it is also important to explain

168
00:10:20.666 --> 00:10:23.250
that destruction

169
00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:26.708
too is part of My creation.

170
00:10:26.708 --> 00:10:32.125
Just as I create and sustain,

171
00:10:32.125 --> 00:10:33.833
in the same way,

172
00:10:33.833 --> 00:10:36.875
when the time comes,

173
00:10:36.875 --> 00:10:38.500
I also

174
00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:43.000
bring things to an end.

175
00:10:43.000 --> 00:10:46.875
This I do not out of cruelty, but

176
00:10:46.875 --> 00:10:48.666
to reflect the nature of time

177
00:10:48.666 --> 00:10:50.750
and the material world.

178
00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:54.208
If your family believes that I

179
00:10:54.208 --> 00:10:57.958
give only pleasant things, then

180
00:10:57.958 --> 00:11:02.375
when difficult times come, faith can weaken.

181
00:11:02.375 --> 00:11:05.791
Such as the loss of a loved one,

182
00:11:05.791 --> 00:11:08.250
the end of a relationship, or

183
00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:11.083
when unexpected hardships arrive.

184
00:11:11.083 --> 00:11:14.375
Just as night comes after day,

185
00:11:14.375 --> 00:11:17.833
exactly so, after joy

186
00:11:17.833 --> 00:11:21.000
sorrow is certain to come.

187
00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:24.458
Just as, not cursing the night,

188
00:11:24.458 --> 00:11:27.875
we find ways to pass through it too,

189
00:11:27.875 --> 00:11:30.875
just as, when the seasons change,

190
00:11:30.875 --> 00:11:32.750
we change our ways of dressing

191
00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:35.416
and find ways to adapt to it,

192
00:11:35.416 --> 00:11:37.041
in the same way,

193
00:11:37.041 --> 00:11:39.958
when difficulties come, instead of grieving

194
00:11:39.958 --> 00:11:41.166
over them,

195
00:11:41.166 --> 00:11:42.833
we should accept them

196
00:11:42.833 --> 00:11:46.333
and take measures to overcome them.

197
00:11:46.333 --> 00:11:49.916
When you understand that endings

198
00:11:49.916 --> 00:11:52.875
are part of the natural cycle,

199
00:11:52.875 --> 00:11:55.333
then accepting these moments

200
00:11:55.333 --> 00:11:58.375
without losing trust in Me

201
00:11:58.375 --> 00:12:01.000
becomes easier.

202
00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:03.750
Teach your family

203
00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:07.750
that everything has its own time,

204
00:12:07.750 --> 00:12:12.083
and nothing in this world is permanent.

205
00:12:12.083 --> 00:12:16.666
When you accept both creation and destruction

206
00:12:16.666 --> 00:12:21.583
as parts of My plan,

207
00:12:21.583 --> 00:12:25.708
then you develop resilience.

208
00:12:25.708 --> 00:12:29.375
Knowing that every day

209
00:12:29.375 --> 00:12:33.166
leads toward a new beginning,

210
00:12:33.166 --> 00:12:37.083
which is guided by My care

211
00:12:37.083 --> 00:12:39.333
and wisdom.

212
00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:45.708
Notice this –

213
00:12:45.708 --> 00:12:48.750
the structure of your own body.

214
00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:51.833
On it, where there are soft parts

215
00:12:51.833 --> 00:12:54.875
like the tongue and lips,

216
00:12:54.875 --> 00:12:57.291
there are also hard parts

217
00:12:57.291 --> 00:13:00.583
like the teeth and bones.

218
00:13:00.583 --> 00:13:03.208
Can the tongue do the work of bone,

219
00:13:03.208 --> 00:13:06.708
and bone do the work of the tongue?

220
00:13:06.708 --> 00:13:08.583
Never.

221
00:13:08.583 --> 00:13:10.541
Understand.

222
00:13:10.541 --> 00:13:12.958
In leadership, both gentleness

223
00:13:12.958 --> 00:13:16.208
and firmness are necessary.

224
00:13:16.208 --> 00:13:17.875
Just as

225
00:13:17.875 --> 00:13:20.208
My Vishwarupa revealed

226
00:13:20.208 --> 00:13:24.500
both My nurturing and all-powerful

227
00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:27.291
sides,

228
00:13:27.291 --> 00:13:30.625
a good leader must know

229
00:13:30.625 --> 00:13:35.458
when to be compassionate and when to be firm.

230
00:13:35.458 --> 00:13:39.500
If you lead only with kindness,

231
00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:42.750
people may take undue advantage of it,

232
00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:46.333
or their focus may wander.

233
00:13:46.333 --> 00:13:47.291
But

234
00:13:47.291 --> 00:13:51.708
if you lead only with strictness,

235
00:13:51.708 --> 00:13:56.958
you may create fear and distance.

236
00:13:56.958 --> 00:13:58.958
True leadership

237
00:13:58.958 --> 00:14:02.583
lies in balancing both.

238
00:14:02.583 --> 00:14:06.000
It is like Arjun, who first

239
00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:09.500
admired the beauty of My form,

240
00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:11.500
but later

241
00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:15.291
also understood its terrifying aspect.

242
00:14:15.291 --> 00:14:18.416
Your team should receive support,

243
00:14:18.416 --> 00:14:21.125
but the weight of responsibility

244
00:14:21.125 --> 00:14:23.208
should also keep being felt by them.

245
00:14:23.208 --> 00:14:27.375
When they face challenges,

246
00:14:27.375 --> 00:14:30.041
show empathy.

247
00:14:30.041 --> 00:14:31.833
But when

248
00:14:31.833 --> 00:14:34.208
performance matters,

249
00:14:34.208 --> 00:14:39.083
hold them to high standards too.

250
00:14:39.083 --> 00:14:40.458
Too much softness

251
00:14:40.458 --> 00:14:43.583
can weaken discipline,

252
00:14:43.583 --> 00:14:49.000
while too much strictness can break morale.

253
00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:51.750
A great leader knows

254
00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:55.500
when to encourage with warmth

255
00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:56.583
and when

256
00:14:56.583 --> 00:15:00.500
to enforce the rules with firmness.

257
00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:03.291
By balancing both sides,

258
00:15:03.291 --> 00:15:06.458
you earn respect,

259
00:15:06.458 --> 00:15:09.083
build trust,

260
00:15:09.083 --> 00:15:12.875
and create a team

261
00:15:12.875 --> 00:15:15.666
that flourishes through both success

262
00:15:15.666 --> 00:15:19.666
and failure.
